  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Hs7Mdzf7/banner.png\" width=\"700\" height=\"265\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>📕 關於：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這個模組是 Farmer's Delight 和 Untamed Wilds 的擴充模組。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🍞 內容：</strong></span></p><div>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">5 種可放置的盛宴</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">2 種效果</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">多種餐點與點心</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特殊生物戰利品取代原版肉類</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🥪 圖片：</strong></span></p><div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/wTSD8v7Y/showcase.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1009\" height=\"800\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/pTC1pH4X/showcase1-1.png\" alt=\"v1.1\" width=\"1011\" height=\"524\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🔨 必要依賴：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/untamedwilds\" rel=\"nofollow\">Untamed Wilds</a>（此模組需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/citadel\" rel=\"nofollow\">Citadel</a>）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Discord？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/fbFRfZtVf5\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></span></p>",
